msgstr "Keramiek"

#. i18n: file ./keramik/config/keramikconfig.ui line 30
#: rc.cpp:6
#, no-c-format
msgid "Display the window &icon in the caption bubble"
msgstr "Vertoon die venster ikoon in die titel borrel"

#. i18n: file ./keramik/config/keramikconfig.ui line 33
#: rc.cpp:9
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want the window icon to be displayed in the caption "
"bubble next to the titlebar text."
msgstr ""
"Kies hierdie opsie indien jy die venster ikoon in die venster borrel, langs die "
"titelbalk teks, vertoon wil hê."

#. i18n: file ./keramik/config/keramikconfig.ui line 41
#: rc.cpp:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "Draw &small caption bubbles on active windows"
msgstr "Trek klein titel borrels op aktiewe vensters"

#. i18n: file ./keramik/config/keramikconfig.ui line 44
#: rc.cpp:15
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want the caption bubble to have the same size on "
"active windows that it has on inactive ones. This option is useful for laptops "
"or low resolution displays where you want maximize the amount of space "
"available to the window contents."
msgstr ""
"Kliek hierdie opsie om die titel borrels te stel sodat dit die selfde grootteop "
"die aktiewe vensters het as op die on-aktiewe. Hierdie opsie is veral geskik op "
"skoot rekenaars of lae-resolusie skerms, waar jy die maksimum gebruik wil maak "
"van die beskikbare spasie vir die venster inhoud."

#. i18n: file ./keramik/config/keramikconfig.ui line 52
#: rc.cpp:18
#, no-c-format
msgid "Draw g&rab bars below windows"
msgstr "Trek gryp balk onder vensters"

#. i18n: file ./keramik/config/keramikconfig.ui line 55
#: rc.cpp:21
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want a grab bar to be drawn below windows. When this "
"option is not selected only a thin border will be drawn in its place."
msgstr ""
"Kliek hierdie opsie indien jy 'n gryp balk aan die onderkant van die venster "
"wil trek. Wanneer hierdie opsie nie gekies is nie, sal daar slegs 'n smal "
"raampie in die plek daarvan getrek word."

#. i18n: file ./keramik/config/keramikconfig.ui line 63
#: rc.cpp:24 rc.cpp:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use shadowed &text"
msgstr "Gebruik beskadude teks"

#. i18n: file ./keramik/config/keramikconfig.ui line 66
#: rc.cpp:27 rc.cpp:48
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want the titlebar text to have a 3D look with a shadow "
"behind it."
msgstr ""
"Kliek hierdie opsie om die titel balk 'n 3D voorkoms te gee met skadus aan die "
"agterkant."

#. i18n: file ./plastik/config/configdialog.ui line 16
#: rc.cpp:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "Config Dialog"
msgstr "Konfigureer Dialoog"

#. i18n: file ./plastik/config/configdialog.ui line 30
#: rc.cpp:33
#, no-c-format
msgid "Title &Alignment"
msgstr "Titel Belyning"

#. i18n: file ./plastik/config/configdialog.ui line 78
#: rc.cpp:51
#, no-c-format
msgid "Animate buttons"
msgstr "Naboots knoppies"

#. i18n: file ./plastik/config/configdialog.ui line 81
#: rc.cpp:54
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want the buttons to fade in when the mouse pointer "
"hovers over them and fade out again when it moves away."
msgstr ""
"Kliek hierdie opsie indien jy wil hê dat die knoppies moet verlig wanneer die "
"muis wyser daaroor huiwer, en weer verdonker wanneer dit weg beweeg."

#. i18n: file ./plastik/config/configdialog.ui line 89
#: rc.cpp:57
#, no-c-format
msgid "Close windows by double clicking the menu button"
msgstr "Sluit venster deur op die keuse knoppie te dubbel-kliek"

#. i18n: file ./plastik/config/configdialog.ui line 92
#: rc.cpp:60
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want windows to be closed when you double click the "
"menu button, similar to Microsoft Windows."
msgstr ""
"Kliek hierdie opsie indien jy wil hê dat die vensters moet sluit wanneer jy op "
"die kesue knoppie dubbel-kliek, soos in Microsoft Windows."

#: quartz/config/config.cpp:42
msgid ""
"When selected, the window decoration borders are drawn using the titlebar "
"colors; otherwise, they are drawn using normal border colors instead."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer gekies, word die venster versier rame getrek deur gebruik te maak van "
"die titelbalk kleure; andersins, word dit getrek met normale raam kleure."

#: quartz/config/config.cpp:45
msgid "Quartz &extra slim"
msgstr "Kwarts ekstra slank"

#: quartz/config/config.cpp:47
msgid "Quartz window decorations with extra-small title bar."
msgstr "Kwarts venster versierings met ekstra klein tiltel balk."

#: quartz/quartz.cpp:574
msgid "<center><b>Quartz preview</b></center>"
msgstr "<center><b>Kwarts voorskou</b></center>"

#: modernsystem/config/config.cpp:40
msgid "&Show window resize handle"
msgstr "Vertoon venster verstel handvatsel"

#: modernsystem/config/config.cpp:42
msgid ""
"When selected, all windows are drawn with a resize handle at the lower right "
"corner. This makes window resizing easier, especially for trackballs and other "
"mouse replacements on laptops."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer gekies, word alle vensters met 'n verstel handvatsel getrek in die "
"regter onderste hoek. Dit maak die verstelling van vensters makliker, veral met "
"rolbol en  ander tipes muise op skoot rekenaars."

#: modernsystem/config/config.cpp:52
msgid "Here you can change the size of the resize handle."
msgstr "Hier kan jy die groote stel van die verstel handvatsel."

